<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<roster id="ja44qrz" name="kb-001-all-units" battleScribeVersion="2.03" generatedBy="https://newrecruit.eu" gameSystemId="e51d-b1a3-75fc-dc3g" gameSystemName="Age of Sigmar 4.0" gameSystemRevision="98" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/rosterSchema"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="3350" /></costs><costLimits><costLimit name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costLimits><forces><force id="jkzobjr" name="✦ General's Handbook 2026-27" entryId="0151-9c5b-2f1e-32d4" catalogueId="8aef-b85d-b63a-ef05" catalogueRevision="41" catalogueName="Kruleboyz"><selections><selection id="saza2jo" name="Allow Legends" entryId="7e59-2237-4890-a80a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" name="Configuration" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="se22p7u" name="Battle Traits: Kruleboyz" entryId="4875-1a37-c671-e67b::7a79-d86e-48ad-a3ce" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ea37-80a7-5d13-d70f" name="Dirty Tricks" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">The effect of a **^^Dirty Trick^^** ability is only applied if you make a successful dirty trick roll. The success of a dirty trick roll depends on the number of **^^Dirty Trick^^** abilities your army has already used this battle round:
**First:**  2+
**Second:** 3+
**Third:** 4+
**Fourth or subsequent:** 5+</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="d85b-8581-433c-efdf" name="Venom-encrusted Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Infantry^^** unit to be the target, then make a dirty trick roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Until the start of your next turn, the target's attacks score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Dirty Trick^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="776e-e29d-64b8-2aa1" name="Lethal Surprise" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit that charged this turn and is in combat with any friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** units to be the target, then make a dirty trick roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target. In addition, for the rest of the turn, the target's weapons cannot be affected by the Charge (+1 Damage) weapon ability</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Dirty Trick^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="5ffc-eff8-8d98-90bc" name="Sneaky Sneakin'" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Infantry^^** unit that has 10 or fewer models,  is not in combat and has not been the target of a **^^Dirty Trick^^** ability this turn to be the target, then make a dirty trick roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove the target from the battlefield and set it up again wholly within 3&quot; of a terrain feature and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Dirty Trick^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="c77c-69ee-70f7-22e1" name="Noisy Racket" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with any friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** units to be the target, then make a dirty trick roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">The target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Dirty Trick^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="3360-1158-e879-9606" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" name="Reference" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="k8689u6" name="Battle Formation" entryId="123c-5475-9fbd-3f22" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="sil29q" name="Battle Formation" entryId="123c-5475-9fbd-3f22" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="kaooey9" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="snpgg0f" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="kc0ixg7" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="8af9-2436-772f-22b9" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="syiso1o" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="8af9-2436-772f-22b9" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="ke6ajy" name="Spell Lore" entryId="b7d3-c523-1d1a-e601" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="kemftgk" name="Lore of the Swamp" entryId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::5966-7fef-4c95-1e1c" entryGroupId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::6e0f-e98f-84b6-8188" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Spell Lores"><selections><selection id="kfcnx1s" name="Choking Mist" entryId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::1ced-992f-8c22-d32d::4df5-e1e9-de24-704a" entryGroupId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::1ced-992f-8c22-d32d::cf9e-5e6f-0ff7-5789" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Swamp"><profiles><profile id="1abd-510b-e57-abb9" name="Choking Mist" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of the target's weapons until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Defensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="kfnokt" name="Da Black Pit" entryId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::1ced-992f-8c22-d32d::f62e-e3d3-de04-5734" entryGroupId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::1ced-992f-8c22-d32d::cf9e-5e6f-0ff7-5789" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Swamp"><profiles><profile id="ac40-170e-df46-82eb" name="Da Black Pit" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Roll a dice for each model in the target unit. For each 6, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="kf91i0x" name="Mork's Kunnin'" entryId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::1ced-992f-8c22-d32d::c525-1031-3525-b76e" entryGroupId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::1ced-992f-8c22-d32d::cf9e-5e6f-0ff7-5789" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Swamp"><profiles><profile id="4541-8384-c6b0-23a5" name="Mork's Kunnin'" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, add 1 to save rolls for attacks that target that friendly unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Defensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="t3r2g4" name="Spell Lore" entryId="b7d3-c523-1d1a-e601" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="t4vztf" name="Lore of the Swamp" entryId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::5966-7fef-4c95-1e1c" entryGroupId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::6e0f-e98f-84b6-8188" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Spell Lores"><selections><selection id="t4pyfq" name="Choking Mist" entryId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::1ced-992f-8c22-d32d::4df5-e1e9-de24-704a" entryGroupId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::1ced-992f-8c22-d32d::cf9e-5e6f-0ff7-5789" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Swamp"><profiles><profile id="1abd-510b-e57-abb9" name="Choking Mist" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of the target's weapons until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Defensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="t4m2lx6" name="Da Black Pit" entryId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::1ced-992f-8c22-d32d::f62e-e3d3-de04-5734" entryGroupId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::1ced-992f-8c22-d32d::cf9e-5e6f-0ff7-5789" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Swamp"><profiles><profile id="ac40-170e-df46-82eb" name="Da Black Pit" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Roll a dice for each model in the target unit. For each 6, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="t40w3n" name="Mork's Kunnin'" entryId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::1ced-992f-8c22-d32d::c525-1031-3525-b76e" entryGroupId="a8b6-8aa0-952-d5ce::1ced-992f-8c22-d32d::cf9e-5e6f-0ff7-5789" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Swamp"><profiles><profile id="4541-8384-c6b0-23a5" name="Mork's Kunnin'" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, add 1 to save rolls for attacks that target that friendly unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Defensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="khmaper" name="Skaregob Totem" entryId="96ca-879a-c202-226c::8346-0ba5-9740-dc49" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><rules><rule id="a061-7873-e16d-1554" name="Skaregob Totem" hidden="false"><description>**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):
Cover, Impassable**</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="c634-841d-23aa-0f5e" name="Man da Tower!" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this terrain feature has a Shouty Boss:
• The Shouty Boss cannot use **^^Move^^** abilities.
• Instead of measuring range or visibility to the Shouty Boss, measure to this terrain feature instead.
• All attacks that would target the Shouty Boss target this terrain feature instead.
• If this terrain feature is destroyed, before removing it from the battlefield, inflict D3 mortal damage on the Shouty Boss. Then, set up the Shouty Boss on the battlefield within 3&quot; of this terrain feature and not in combat. That unit is no longer the Shouty Boss. If it is not possible to set up the Shouty Boss, it is slain.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="0da3-10a7-73c5-d399" name="Skaregob Totem" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">12</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="3217-c0c2-95d5-ce9b" name="Up We Go!" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this terrain feature does not have a Shouty Boss , pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Infantry Hero^^** that is not in combat and is within 3&quot; of it  to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Place the target on this terrain feature. The target is now a Shouty Boss (see 'Man da Tower').</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="912f-1155-0af4-2a0b" name="Sinister Stare" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to dirty trick rolls for friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** units wholly within 12&quot; of this terrain feature or for enemy units within 12&quot; of this terrain feature. If this terrain feature has a Shouty Boss, add 1 to dirty trick rolls for friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** units wholly within 18&quot; of this terrain feature instead of wholly within 12&quot; or for enemy units within 18&quot; of this terrain feature instead of within 12&quot;.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="e0d9-25bd-1253-3468" name="I'm Off!" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this terrain feature has a Shouty Boss that was not placed on it this turn, set up the Shouty Boss on the battlefield wholly within 6&quot; of this terrain feature and not in combat. That unit is no longer the Shouty Boss.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" name="FACTION TERRAIN" primary="true" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="t9t5twe" name="Skaregob Totem" entryId="96ca-879a-c202-226c::8346-0ba5-9740-dc49" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><rules><rule id="a061-7873-e16d-1554" name="Skaregob Totem" hidden="false"><description>**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):
Cover, Impassable**</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="c634-841d-23aa-0f5e" name="Man da Tower!" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this terrain feature has a Shouty Boss:
• The Shouty Boss cannot use **^^Move^^** abilities.
• Instead of measuring range or visibility to the Shouty Boss, measure to this terrain feature instead.
• All attacks that would target the Shouty Boss target this terrain feature instead.
• If this terrain feature is destroyed, before removing it from the battlefield, inflict D3 mortal damage on the Shouty Boss. Then, set up the Shouty Boss on the battlefield within 3&quot; of this terrain feature and not in combat. That unit is no longer the Shouty Boss. If it is not possible to set up the Shouty Boss, it is slain.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="0da3-10a7-73c5-d399" name="Skaregob Totem" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">12</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="3217-c0c2-95d5-ce9b" name="Up We Go!" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this terrain feature does not have a Shouty Boss , pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Infantry Hero^^** that is not in combat and is within 3&quot; of it  to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Place the target on this terrain feature. The target is now a Shouty Boss (see 'Man da Tower').</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="912f-1155-0af4-2a0b" name="Sinister Stare" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to dirty trick rolls for friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** units wholly within 12&quot; of this terrain feature or for enemy units within 12&quot; of this terrain feature. If this terrain feature has a Shouty Boss, add 1 to dirty trick rolls for friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** units wholly within 18&quot; of this terrain feature instead of wholly within 12&quot; or for enemy units within 18&quot; of this terrain feature instead of within 12&quot;.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="e0d9-25bd-1253-3468" name="I'm Off!" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this terrain feature has a Shouty Boss that was not placed on it this turn, set up the Shouty Boss on the battlefield wholly within 6&quot; of this terrain feature and not in combat. That unit is no longer the Shouty Boss.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" name="FACTION TERRAIN" primary="true" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /></categories></selection></selections><costs><cost name="Force Category - GHB" typeId="de92-2099-fbf7-a156" value="1" /></costs><categories><category name="Configuration" id="ftdti3e" primary="false" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" /><category name="Reference" id="ftke39p" primary="false" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" /><category name="Army Composition" id="jnqwoci" primary="false" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" /><category name="FACTION TERRAIN" id="jnkw7y" primary="false" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" /><category name="Illegal Units" id="n667x07" primary="false" entryId="(Illegal Units)" /></categories><forces><force id="8p1wm3o" name="Auxillary Units" entryId="6084-3baa-f00b-ac0a::8732-47c4-9f1c-e71e" catalogueId="8aef-b85d-b63a-ef05" catalogueRevision="41" catalogueName="Kruleboyz"><selections><selection id="tdffqs" name="Breaka-boss on Mirebrute Troggoth" entryId="abea-706a-64f7-a082::5616-42d8-b4aa-2e4" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="cc6b-2d8b-ee31-39db" name="Breaka-boss on Mirebrute Troggoth" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">12</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d00e-94c4-5a1d-1f0b" name="Tear Limb From Limb" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Infantry^^** unit within 1&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. If the roll exceeds the target's Health characteristic, 1 model in the target unit is slain.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="31be-22a2-7fc7-fd49" name="Breaka-harness" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Make a breaka-roll of D3.
• Inflict an amount of mortal damage on this unit equal to the breaka-roll.
• Double the breaka-roll and add that value to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Mirebrute's Clubs** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="a8eb-326-e2dc-155c" name="Regeneration" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Start of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">**Heal (D3)** this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="tfzrdd" name="Breaka-boss on Mirebrute Troggoth" entryId="abea-706a-64f7-a082::8cfa-aec1-f91f-4973" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="took7qe" name="Bident-goad" entryId="abea-706a-64f7-a082::124b-a43f-dfa3-189d" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="9f2e-8cd0-7b57-5725" name="Bident-goad" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="tojfxj" name="Mirebrute's Clubs" entryId="abea-706a-64f7-a082::2382-599c-cb2c-c7a7" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1fb-b78d-5af6-54a2" name="Mirebrute's Clubs" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="180" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="ufvfdi09" name="Gobsprakk, the Mouth of Mork" entryId="9a3e-420f-c187-70c8::98a8-f41c-6668-fed1" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="10b5-5102-351f-bd92" name="Gobsprakk, the Mouth of Mork" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ecaf-85de-8ed1-5873" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Killabeak's Talons and Beak** is 5.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="92db-5a9a-e94f-1358" name="Screamin' Mandrakk" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Spell^^** ability</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">This unit uses the 'Unbind' ability but the unbinding roll is 3D6 instead of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8afa-479f-cabb-3389" name="Crush to Death" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. If the roll exceeds the target's Health characteristic, 1 model in the target unit is slain.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="e791-1836-ae72-7ba2" name="Mork Sez No!" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time this unit unbinds a spell, inflict D3 mortal damage on the caster. If the unbinding roll was 10+, inflict D6 mortal damage on the caster instead.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="7bbe-474e-6d-c403" name="Strangle Hex" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Roll a number of dice equal to the target's Health characteristic, to a maximum of 10. For each 4+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ug0mru" name="Gobsprakk, the Mouth of Mork" entryId="9a3e-420f-c187-70c8::3795-1d9e-46b8-524b" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="uil9xnd" name="Bogbark Staff" entryId="9a3e-420f-c187-70c8::13b3-b25c-9954-2ea0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="65a7-470a-b634-ab05" name="Bogbark Staff" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti-**^^Wizard^^** (+1 Rend), Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="ui1ljku" name="Killabeak's Stinger" entryId="9a3e-420f-c187-70c8::d062-9173-8ed8-ae9c" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="d53c-a321-464-f9fb" name="Killabeak's Stinger" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D6</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal), Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="uicq8nd" name="Killabeak's Talons and Beak" entryId="9a3e-420f-c187-70c8::84bd-789c-19ff-e6c1" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="470e-3ef2-5f24-b2b" name="Killabeak's Talons and Beak" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti-**^^Wizard^^** (+1 Rend), Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="240" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="utmu4c4" name="Hobgrot Slittaboss" entryId="e2c0-7584-0844-1e1c::3bd7-2a9f-9356-b454" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="470f-aab0-10fd-e001" name="Hobgrot Slittaboss" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4eff-2023-8e44-9886" name="Toxic Stash" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Infantry Hero^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll 2D6. If the roll exceeds the target's Health characteristic, it is automatically destroyed.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="f234-2bbf-4307-20f9" name="Kompany Taktikz" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** ability for this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly **Hobgrot Slittaz** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to wound rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="uulhvs9" name="Hobgrot Slittaboss" entryId="e2c0-7584-0844-1e1c::0860-c5b3-1781-e55d" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="v1e2moy" name="Toxin-smeared Slitta-sword" entryId="e2c0-7584-0844-1e1c::bc3b-eb25-adcd-1221" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="12bd-87d5-e824-e743" name="Toxin-smeared Slitta-sword" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="70" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="vek25y" name="Killaboss on Corpse-rippa Vulcha" entryId="3f75-d4c7-9594-e4dc::9963-d56-fbf8-b8a8" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="3b22-89b9-78a8-a78a" name="Killaboss on Corpse-rippa Vulcha" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="28be-296d-d307-d2a6" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Vulcha's Talons and Beak** is 5.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="a503-fb02-1b10-63d4" name="Commanding View" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: You declared the 'Redeploy' command for a friendly **Gutrippaz** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If you roll a 1-3 when determining the distance that unit can move, you can use a value of 4 instead.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="9a83-ae52-a908-fe70" name="Vulcha Dive" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this phase, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a number of dice equal to the unmodified charge roll. For each 4+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="vfb0ar" name="Killaboss on Corpse-rippa Vulcha" entryId="3f75-d4c7-9594-e4dc::4d81-805-e70b-f2ad" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="voh468j" name="Boss-stikka or Boss-hacka" entryId="3f75-d4c7-9594-e4dc::c50f-5741-4573-4a52" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="571b-30d0-ff30-d79c" name="Boss-stikka or Boss-hacka" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="vpbivs9" name="Vulcha's Stinger" entryId="3f75-d4c7-9594-e4dc::83a9-3ec7-1087-bb8e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="fdd4-e9a3-f18-67e9" name="Vulcha's Stinger" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D6</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal), Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="vpsdvxg" name="Vulcha's Talons and Beak" entryId="3f75-d4c7-9594-e4dc::8abd-85b7-3292-3107" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="7a8b-8f58-1512-d0c3" name="Vulcha's Talons and Beak" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="240" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="w4xb1v8" name="Killaboss on Great Gnashtoof" entryId="db61-2645-ed6a-2202::b780-2683-34de-ec5" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="144c-8c37-cd54-4269" name="Killaboss on Great Gnashtoof" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="82eb-4034-2f5f-7e38" name="That's Ours, Ya Gitz" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit is contesting an objective you do not control, add 1 to hit rolls for combat attacks made by friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** units wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="302a-3890-a15-933f" name="All Part of da Plan" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick another friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** unit wholly within 9&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 3 to the target's control score until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Control</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="w4lpvut" name="Killaboss on Great Gnashtoof" entryId="db61-2645-ed6a-2202::24d6-b9b6-4ba8-66b0" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="wccg92" name="Boss-stikka" entryId="db61-2645-ed6a-2202::701d-51b6-f5f7-9ad9" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="f555-d93f-1c9c-2931" name="Boss-stikka" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="wcsshso" name="Great Gnashtoof's Jaws" entryId="db61-2645-ed6a-2202::bfce-d551-9a48-f07e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="bafe-774d-c40d-d13" name="Great Gnashtoof's Jaws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="130" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /><category id="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" name="CAVALRY" entryId="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="wqboo5q" name="Killaboss on Great Gnashtoof (Scourge of Aqshy)" entryId="242a-37b8-1592-c2db::7441-c95d-12a2-245a" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="f004-4965-1216-3334" name="Killaboss on Great Gnashtoof" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d9b0-7c66-0260-c4f5" name="Prowling the Flanks" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is wholly within 6&quot; of the battlefield edge, remove it from the battlefield and set it up again wholly within 6&quot; of the battlefield edge and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="2649-d138-6ce6-4385" name="Drag 'Em Out" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Infantry Hero^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll 2D6. This unit can move a distance in inches up to the value of the roll. Then, if possible, your opponent must remove the target from the battlefield and set it up again within 1&quot; of this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="wrbr01" name="Killaboss on Great Gnashtoof" entryId="242a-37b8-1592-c2db::6bd0-e3b2-c449-c90d" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="wyl7ksj" name="Boss-skewa" entryId="242a-37b8-1592-c2db::a929-8876-d3ea-a592" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="604d-5a6e-5974-b9ff" name="Boss-skewa" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti-Hero (+1 Rend), Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="wzbvvj4" name="Great Gnashtoof's Jaws" entryId="242a-37b8-1592-c2db::7c7d-bfd3-c531-b123" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="aeab-6c62-cf96-c1de" name="Great Gnashtoof's Jaws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="230" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /><category id="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" name="CAVALRY" entryId="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="xdsdaj5" name="Killaboss with Stab-grot" entryId="ada6-db1-6998-c930::17d5-b7e8-6b70-9260" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5f40-c330-abc1-8013" name="Killaboss with Stab-grot" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7a89-1ae3-bc61-18af" name="Keep 'Em in Line" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: You declared the 'All-out Attack' command for a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Infantry^^** unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is wholly within 12&quot; of the unit using the 'All-out Attack' command, add 1 to wound rolls for combat attacks made by that unit for the rest of the phase.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="16be-7a64-3d36-29ad" name="Unleash the Stab-grot!" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following effects:
• Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target. Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target.
• This unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^** for the rest of the turn.
After resolving either effect, remove this unit's **Stab-grot** from the battlefield.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="68ce-eda-1202-2c09" name="Stab-grot" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit's **Stab-grot** is a token. If this unit's **Stab grot** has been removed, it can no longer attack with its **Stab-grot's Shiv** and it cannot use the 'Unleash the Stab-grot!' ability.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="xefa2wc" name="Killaboss with Stab-grot" entryId="ada6-db1-6998-c930::a580-37d8-acb3-520" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="xm58u2m" name="Boss-hacka" entryId="ada6-db1-6998-c930::fa34-a0ad-bf26-95a4" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="6b02-630f-7f4-64d6" name="Boss-hacka" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="xmwgz69" name="Stab-grot's Shiv" entryId="ada6-db1-6998-c930::a84e-3261-9ca2-a15e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="7ab-b2d6-a793-15f4" name="Stab-grot's Shiv" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal), Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="80" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="y2r52tk" name="Killaboss with Stab-grot (Scourge of Aqshy)" entryId="2c98-e11b-e76d-96b9::a939-6da8-83d5-cf31" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="bd57-2f97-bb4a-99e7" name="Killaboss with Stab-grot" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="97ed-b5da-5648-b006" name="Just Keep Stabbin'" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a number of dice equal to your fury level. You can spend 1 rage dice. If you do:
• Add 1 to each roll.
• If your opponent's fury level is lower than yours, they must increase their fury level by 1, to a maximum of 7.
Then, for each 3+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="5a7b-b023-56e6-373a" name="Jump 'Em, Ladz, Or Else!" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** ability for this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly **Gutrippaz** or **Hobgrot Slittaz** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target.
The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's melee weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="y31yxr8" name="Killaboss with Stab-grot" entryId="2c98-e11b-e76d-96b9::7c86-7768-b6cc-ac98" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="ybeuyh4" name="Boss-hacka" entryId="2c98-e11b-e76d-96b9::f33b-29e2-c52c-3976" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="693e-1f5f-fff8-ba4e" name="Boss-hacka" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="130" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="yrxw2xf" name="Kragnos, the End of Empires" entryId="8e30-54e4-64cf-39ba::2a45-46b2-62f9-63cc" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="d49a-ca03-104-c44b" name="Kragnos, the End of Empires" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">18</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">15</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d590-353e-2fe2-e54d" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **The Dread Mace** is 4 and this unit has a Control characteristic of 10.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="1682-108e-330e-4da0" name="Avatar of Destruction" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this unit would be automatically destroyed, it is not automatically destroyed. Instead, allocate 6 damage points to it (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points).</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="1295-7f6e-c910-5c9d" name="Rampaging Destruction" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit charged this phase, pick 1 of the following effects:
• Roll a dice for each enemy unit within 1&quot; of this unit. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on that unit equal to the roll.
• Pick an enemy **^^Monster^^** in combat with this unit and roll 2D6. On a 7, this ability has no effect. Otherwise, inflict an amount of mortal damage on that unit equal to the results on the dice used for the 2D6 roll multiplied together. For example, a 2D6 roll of 2 and 6 would inflict 12 mortal damage (2 × 6).</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="e5b8-2d37-259d-87a6" name="The End of Empires" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, add 1 to the number of dice rolled when making charge rolls for friendly **^^Destruction^^** units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit, to a maximum of 3.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ec2f-e8e-94ff-9aa0" name="The Shield Inviolate" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Spell^^** ability</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit was picked to be the target of that spell, roll a dice. On a 3+, ignore the effect of that spell on this unit. This unit can use this ability more than once per phase but only once per **^^Spell^^** ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ysbpc8" name="Kragnos, the End of Empires" entryId="8e30-54e4-64cf-39ba::11bd-e956-ea84-5e76" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="yvluuw4" name="Hooves of Wrack and Ruin" entryId="8e30-54e4-64cf-39ba::e41b-4676-aafd-cf28" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="aab8-2038-53ff-1cd" name="Hooves of Wrack and Ruin" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="yui3df" name="The Dread Mace" entryId="8e30-54e4-64cf-39ba::59d8-824-dd81-4d9e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="62cc-c03b-f390-ea56" name="The Dread Mace" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="yvaiyuk" name="Tuskbreaker" entryId="8e30-54e4-64cf-39ba::ac7f-a30d-3a72-a496" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="799e-d1d1-3f33-aa37" name="Tuskbreaker" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (2 Hits)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="580" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="c1ca-4b17-3512-89f" name="IRONJAWZ" entryId="c1ca-4b17-3512-89f" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="zg1ltvd" name="Murknob with Belcha-banna" entryId="3991-707f-d46b-935c::3ce1-f1a5-cbd9-1831" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="fa36-1cc5-e9ab-2ee" name="Murknob with Belcha-banna" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e6a7-d54f-3591-683e" name="Power of Kragnos" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** units have **^^Ward (6+)^^** while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="7c4e-3496-5fcb-7b90" name="Breath of the Mire-drakes" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick each enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice for each target. On a 1, this ability has no effect. On a 2-5, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target. On a 6, inflict D3 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="zhrhy28" name="Murknob with Belcha-banna" entryId="3991-707f-d46b-935c::8bfe-7b92-7ad3-23d" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="zoqxys" name="Murknob Cleaver" entryId="3991-707f-d46b-935c::e357-716f-ca62-af17" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5d37-11d5-2532-132b" name="Murknob Cleaver" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="80" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="062ovb6" name="Snatchaboss on Sludgeraker Beast" entryId="daa4-5b7b-3265-e72e::60a9-d871-f253-146c" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ff5f-967a-19b5-7952" name="Snatchaboss on Sludgeraker Beast" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="9f84-fee7-77d9-c7a7" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Sludgeraker's Talons** is 4.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="870a-823c-3227-9fd9" name="Festering Wounds" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 enemy units that had any damage points allocated to them this turn by attacks made by this unit or a friendly unit with the **^^Sludgeraker Venom^^** keyword to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+:
• Inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.
• Subtract 1 from wound rolls for the target's attacks until the end of the next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="1330-92f4-62d7-e0fc" name="Sludgeraker Venom" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">That unit has the **^^Sludgeraker Venom^^** keyword for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="07xnl8a" name="Snatchaboss on Sludgeraker Beast" entryId="daa4-5b7b-3265-e72e::1c3d-5897-a1a6-bea7" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="0gdmkxc" name="Grappling Hook" entryId="daa4-5b7b-3265-e72e::9c8c-b804-406c-1c97" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="6bbb-571c-af46-794e" name="Grappling Hook" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="0gbtyi7" name="Sludgeraker's Bite" entryId="daa4-5b7b-3265-e72e::52fc-183e-7451-4c27" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="eda8-8c2d-75ba-d511" name="Sludgeraker's Bite" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3+3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="0gz38fh" name="Sludgeraker's Talons" entryId="daa4-5b7b-3265-e72e::22b9-23a6-1ee-955a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1d76-8580-dded-4715" name="Sludgeraker's Talons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="180" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="0x9dw4g" name="Swampboss Skumdrekk" entryId="7a6e-dc55-4eae-4d5e::57d2-f5d7-ec57-5d4a" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4ac0-bd62-51bd-edad" name="Swampboss Skumdrekk" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">15</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ada7-b28b-85bc-63f0" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Sloppklaw's Talons** is 4.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="4fd8-d39b-7cf6-52cf" name="Kountin' Krew" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Deployment Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **Hobgrot Slittaz** unit within this unit's combat range to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the battle, the target's **Slitta-knives** have **Crit (Mortal)** while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="bdd3-1da1-2cd9-4cd6" name="Aggravate Wounds" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Monster^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a number of dice equal to the number of damage points the target has. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="d047-3e65-3f04-ee19" name="Bet-master" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Deployment Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit on the battlefield to be **the bet**.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to wound rolls for attacks made by this unit and friendly **Hobgrot Slittaz** units that target **the bet**.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="0y070v" name="Swampboss Skumdrekk" entryId="7a6e-dc55-4eae-4d5e::b60c-38c5-6f49-e4aa" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="10kmmwq" name="Sloppklaw's Bite" entryId="7a6e-dc55-4eae-4d5e::b290-6805-ad24-aab" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="8664-fb90-9db-10ca" name="Sloppklaw's Bite" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3+3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="100ln5j" name="Sloppklaw's Talons" entryId="7a6e-dc55-4eae-4d5e::9650-c94d-c433-b95a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="7027-41e7-b463-7366" name="Sloppklaw's Talons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="10mo0f" name="Snatcha-stikk" entryId="7a6e-dc55-4eae-4d5e::b350-c8bd-2027-e5a6" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="207c-eaf6-1295-1f4" name="Snatcha-stikk" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="150" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="1ghrq2" name="Swampcalla Shaman with Pot-grot" entryId="7299-6dfa-8c4b-cd9c::5f19-cef-ee2-f796" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="672e-8a30-8086-db5a" name="Swampcalla Shaman with Pot-grot" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d363-4b83-3336-23e7" name="Pot-grot" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit's **Pot-grot** is a token. Add 1 to casting rolls for this unit while its **Pot-grot** is on the battlefield. If you make an unmodified casting roll of 4 or less for this unit, remove its **Pot-grot** from the battlefield.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="1e3f-fdab-17f2-4d47" name="Foul Elixirs" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 2+, add 1 to save rolls for the target for the rest of the turn. On a 1, inflict D3 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="1hxrkz" name="Swampcalla Shaman with Pot-grot" entryId="7299-6dfa-8c4b-cd9c::d546-9e8b-3863-65be" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="1ncgg94" name="Bogbark Staff" entryId="7299-6dfa-8c4b-cd9c::a2da-6083-4948-e9ba" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="3196-f7ce-cdc4-d061" name="Bogbark Staff" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" name="KRULEBOYZ" entryId="6e42-3c75-4cb5-337a" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="xhbeda" name="Da Kunnin' Krew" entryId="9b83-0242-f76e-2893::7d2e-ce9a-1dd6-1aad" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="3956-9380-65c8-0e23" name="Da Kunnin' Krew" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="de3b-3124-d09c-48ea" name="Easy Meat" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Enemy Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. If the roll is at least double the target's Health characteristic, 1 model in the target unit is slain.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="xj5akkj" name="Gikkit" entryId="9b83-0242-f76e-2893::c539-0aec-7ded-f596" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="xjxqw6t" name="Krew Weapons" entryId="9b83-0242-f76e-2893::5ba5-5c2e-5a02-6581" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile